{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-15-1","title":"Job 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Eliphaz reproves Job for impiety in justifying himself. 17 He proves by tradition the unquietness of wicked men.</p>\n<p>Eliphaz. 2:11; 4:1; 22:1; 42:7,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-2","title":"Job 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>a wise man. 11:2,3; 13:2; Jas 3:13 vain knowledge. Heb. knowledge of wind. 6:26; 8:2 fill. Ho 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-3","title":"Job 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>he reason. 13:4,5; 16:2,3; 26:1-3; Mal 3:13-15; Mt 12:36,37; Col 4:6 1Ti 6:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-4","title":"Job 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>castest off. Heb. makest void. 4:5,6; 6:14; Ps 36:1-3; 119:126; Zep 1:6; Ro 3:31; Ga 2:21 restrainest. 5:8; 27:10; 1Ch 10:13,14; Ho 7:14; Am 6:10; Lu 18:1 prayer. or, speech.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-5","title":"Job 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>uttereth. Heb. teacheth. 9:22-24; 12:6; Mr 7:21,22; Lu 6:45; Jas 1:26 thou choosest. Ps 50:19,20; 52:2-4; 64:3; 120:2,3; Jer 9:3-5,8; Jas 3:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-6","title":"Job 15:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>own mouth. 9:20; Ps 64:8; Mt 12:37; 26:65; Lu 19:22 thine own. 33:8-12; 34:5-9; 35:2,3; 40:8; 42:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-7","title":"Job 15:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the first. 10; 12:12; Ge 4:1 or wast thou. 38:4-41; Ps 90:2; Pr 8:22-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-8","title":"Job 15:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the secret. 11:6; De 29:29; Ps 25:14; Pr 3:32; Jer 23:18; Am 3:7; Mt 11:25 Mt 13:11,35; Joh 15:15; Ro 11:34; 16:25,26; 1Co 2:9-11,16 thou restrain. 12:2; 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-9","title":"Job 15:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>knowest. 13:2; 26:3,4; 2Co 10:7; 11:5,21-30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-10","title":"Job 15:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the gray-headed. 8:8-10; 12:20; 32:6,7; De 32:7; Pr 16:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-11","title":"Job 15:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the consolations. 5:8-26; 11:13-19; 2Co 1:3-5; 7:6 is there. 8; 13:2; 1Ki 22:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-12","title":"Job 15:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>thine heart. Ec 11:9; Mr 7:21,22; Ac 5:3,4; 8:22; Jas 1:14,15 thy eyes. 17:2; Ps 35:19; Pr 6:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-13","title":"Job 15:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>turnest. 25-27; 9:4; Ro 8:7,8 and lettest. 10:3; 12:6; Ps 34:13; Mal 3:13; Jas 1:26; 3:2-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-14","title":"Job 15:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>is man. 9:2; 14:4; 25:4-6; 1Ki 8:46; 2Ch 6:36; Ps 14:3; 51:5; Pr 20:9 Ec 7:20,29; Joh 3:6; Ro 7:18; Ga 3:22; Eph 2:2,3; 1Jo 1:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-15","title":"Job 15:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>he putteth. 4:18; 25:5; Isa 6:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-16","title":"Job 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>How much.Rather, \"How much less {aph kee,} abominable and filthy man,\" who, under the influence of sinful propensities, commits sin as greedily as a thirsty man or camel drinks down water.</p>\n<p>abominable. 4:19; 42:6; Ps 14:1-3; 53:3; Ro 1:28-30; 3:9-19; Tit 3:3 drinketh. 20:12; 34:7; Pr 19:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-17","title":"Job 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>hear me. 5:27; 13:5,6; 33:1; 34:2; 36:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-18","title":"Job 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>from their. 10; 8:8; Ps 71:18; 78:3-6; Isa 38:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-19","title":"Job 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Unto whom. Ge 10:25,32; De 32:8; Joe 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-20","title":"Job 15:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>travaileth. Ro 8:22; Ec 9:3 the number. Ps 90:3,4,12; Lu 12:19-21; Jas 5:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-21","title":"Job 15:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>dreadful sound. Heb. sound of fears. 18:11; Ge 3:9,10; Le 26:36; 2Ki 7:6; Pr 1:26,27 in prosperity. 1:13-19; 20:5-7,22-24; Le 26:36; 1Sa 25:36-38; Ps 73:18-20; 92:7 Ac 12:21-23; 1Th 5:3 the destroyer. 1Co 10:10; Re 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-22","title":"Job 15:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>He believeth not. 6:11; 9:16; 2Ki 6:33; Isa 8:21,22; Mt 27:5 and he is. 20:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-23","title":"Job 15:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>wandereth. 30:3,4; Ge 4:12; Ps 59:15; 109:10; La 5:6,9; Heb 11:37,38 the day. 18:5,6,12,18; Ec 11:8; Joe 2:2; Am 5:20; Zep 1:15; Heb 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-24","title":"Job 15:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>anguish. 6:2-4; Ps 119:143; Pr 1:27; Isa 13:3; Mt 26:37,38; Ro 2:9 as a king. Pr 6:11; 24:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-25","title":"Job 15:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>he stretcheth. Le 26:23; Ps 73:9,11; Isa 27:4; Da 5:23; Mal 3:13; Ac 9:5; 12:1,23 strengtheneth. 9:4; 40:9-11; Ex 5:2,3; 9:17; 1Sa 4:7-9; 6:6; Ps 52:7; Isa 8:9,10 Isa 10:12-14; 41:4-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-26","title":"Job 15:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>runneth. 2Ch 28:22; 32:13-17 even on. 16:12; Ge 49:8; Ps 18:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-27","title":"Job 15:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>he covereth. 17:10; De 32:15; Ps 17:10; 73:7; 78:31; Isa 6:10; Jer 5:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-28","title":"Job 15:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>desolate. 3:14; 18:15; Isa 5:8-10; Mic 7:18 which are ready. Jer 9:11; 26:18; 51:37; Mic 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-29","title":"Job 15:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>neither shall. 20:22-28; 22:15-20; 27:16,17; Ps 49:16,17; Lu 12:19-21; 16:2,19-22 Jas 1:11; 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-30","title":"Job 15:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>depart. 22; 10:21,22; 18:5,6,18; Mt 8:12; 22:13; 2Pe 2:17; Jude 1:13 the flame. 20:26; Isa 30:33; Eze 15:4-7; 20:47,48; Mt 25:41; Mr 9:43-49 2Th 1:8,9 by the breath. 4:9; Isa 11:4; Re 19:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-31","title":"Job 15:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>not him. 12:16; Isa 44:20; Ga 6:3,7; Eph 5:6 trust. Ps 62:10; Isa 59:4; Jon 2:8 for vanity. 4:8; Pr 22:8; Isa 17:10,11; Ho 8:7; Ga 6:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-32","title":"Job 15:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>accomplished. or, cut off. 22:16; Ps 55:23; Ec 7:17 and his branch. 8:16-19; 14:7-9; 18:16,17; Ps 52:5-8; Isa 27:11; Eze 17:8-10 Ho 9:16; 14:5-7; Joh 15:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-33","title":"Job 15:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>shake off. Isa 33:9; Re 6:13 and. De 28:39,40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-34","title":"Job 15:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>the congregation. 8:13; 20:1; 27:8; 36:13; Isa 33:14,15; Mt 24:51 the tabernacles. 11:14; 12:6; 22:5-9; 29:12-17; 1Sa 8:3; 12:3; Mic 7:2; Am 5:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-15-35","title":"Job 15:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>conceive. Ps 7:14; Isa 59:4,5; Ho 10:13; Ga 6:7,8; Jas 1:15 vanity. or, iniquity.</p>"}]}